{"reviewId": "239932584_89lv6PPno", "review": {"abstract": "从以10年期美国国债实际收益率为代表的实际利率与黄金价格的关系可以看出，黄金价格与实际利率在长周期维持稳定的负相关关系，并且黄金价格运行的重要高点均与实际利率的低点相对应。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "2026年美元加息，黄金并没有跳水，其背后逻辑应该是全球已经对美元信用的怀疑。美国目前的债务高台垒筑，尽管美联储加息，可为什么美元没有像以前一样疯狂回流美国?原因可能是大家对美国国债后期能偿还债务能力的担忧，美国虽然还是全球技术高地，但是中国在权利追赶，新的技术爆点还没有到来，拉升经济的时刻还没到。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "11788-11874", "createTime": 1779636682, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "239932584_89lv6PPno", "userVid": 239932584, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 239932584, "name": "子橘", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/OUicWJdJoz3HJ0bq9GbaiajG8UnprHodQ7wlA5CwiaxBgvogm23hGiaD9ic7WBHlxibhyAuzItvsLdJNI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "子橘", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 3183165, "name": "Chan", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/0Lx53tbXl5m4uHibjMfo7AvyxJ11bIniabI8xOa7qwf5SiaYGcjENQQL7xkeGEpAMW5TcMVqzCExZN7B96QFyYcnF6xd1iaohgZdjeicZ4RaVo4E/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalI